{
  "format": 1,
  "kind": "palette",
  "notes": [
    "The palette a new document starts from (document.new): the world and",
    "outfit tiers of the site's palette as they were when the engine moved here",
    "(jlawcordova.github.io at 3d2a9d1, src/assets/pixel-art/source/palette.mjs).",
    "",
    "- world: at most 32. Seven 4-shade material ramps (1 = highlight … 4 =",
    "  shadow), plus ink, cream and two skin tones.",
    "- outfit: at most 16 clothing colors, only for objects that extend",
    "  character. Each ramp is light to dark.",
    "Names are unique across the tiers. Colors are added by hand."
  ],
